#var, use "command >Rest Client: Switch Environment" in search bar of vs code 

@id = 1 

### Get all groups
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/groups HTTP/1.1 
Content-Type: application/json 

### Get group by ID 
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/groups/{{id}} HTTP/1.1 
Content-Type: application/json 

### Create a new group
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/groups HTTP/1.1 
Content-Type: application/json 

{
  "number": "G-101",
  "status": "ACTIVE",
  "academicLoadIds": ["60f7a5c4d5b5e40c8c234567", "60f7a5c4d5b5e40c8c234568"]
}

### Update an existing group
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/v1/groups/{{id}} HTTP/1.1 
Content-Type: application/json 

{
  "number": "G-102",
  "status": "INACTIVE",
  "academicLoadIds": ["60f7a5c4d5b5e40c8c234569"]
}

### Delete a group
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/v1/groups/{{id}} HTTP/1.1 
Content-Type: application/json

